COMPONENT MANAGEMENT COMMANDS:
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  component install [COMPONENT]    Install component(s)
                                    - No args: install all
