}

show_help_component() {
    cat << 'EOF'
Component Management - Detailed Help
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

AVAILABLE COMPONENTS:

  database    - PostgreSQL + Redis (data storage & caching)
  storage     - InfluxDB (time-series data)
  monitoring  - Prometheus + Grafana (metrics & dashboards)
  messaging   - ZMQ Publisher + Subscriber (message broker)
  api         - Python API service
  gateway     - Go Gateway service
  processor   - Rust processor
  proxy       - Nginx reverse proxy

COMMANDS:

  component start [COMPONENT]
    Start one or more components in dependency order
    Examples:
      component start database          # Start PostgreSQL + Redis
      component start messaging         # Start ZMQ services
      component start api gateway       # Start both API and Gateway

  component stop [COMPONENT]
    Stop one or more components gracefully
    Examples:
      component stop proxy              # Stop Nginx
      component stop all                # Stop all components

  component status
    Display status of all components
    Output shows running components with ✓ or ✗

  component restart [COMPONENT]
    Stop and then start a component
    Useful for clearing state or reloading configuration

  component logs [COMPONENT]
    Follow component logs
    Examples:
      component logs publisher          # Follow ZMQ publisher
      component logs subscriber         # Follow ZMQ subscriber

EOF
}

